    "detailed_description": "Welcome in the primitive era, you are the last warrior of your fallen tribe. By using your magic powers, your stamina, and your wisdom, you will succeed to tame a world where the wildlife and the elements will be hostile. Conquer territories with game mechanics mixing R.P.G., fight, team managment, and base managment. As a tribe leader, you will dispose of many customizing features on its several characters, like behaviour customization of any tribe member. Let yourself be seduced by a procedural world, where ecosystems and magic coexist.",
